    "guide": { "type": "seo-guide", "settings": { "background": "default", "content": "<h2>Your mattress is the most expensive piece of furniture in your bedroom. Protect it.</h2><p>Three reasons to protect your mattress in UAE: dust settles into foam and degrades it faster; humidity and sweat (especially May–September) can stain and damage foam; and waterproofing is essential in homes with children.</p><h3>Depth guide</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Pocket Depth</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Single (190×90 cm)</td><td>25 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Small Double (200×120 cm)</td><td>25 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Queen (200×150 cm)</td><td>30 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Double (200×160 cm)</td><td>30 cm</td></tr><tr><td>King (200×180 cm)</td><td>35 cm</td></tr><tr><td>Super King (200×200 cm)</td><td>35 cm</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Why LUNA PRIME doesn't crinkle</h3><p>Many waterproof protectors use a noisy plastic-backed fabric. LUNA PRIME's breathable membrane stays silent through the night while still fully blocking moisture.</p><h3>Washing a waterproof protector</h3><p>Machine wash warm (not hot, to protect the membrane) and air-dry or tumble dry on low — avoid high heat, which can damage the waterproof backing.</p>" } },
